{
  "rewrites": [
    {
      "source": "/about",
      "destination": "/about.html"
    },
    {
      "source": "/booking",
      "destination": "/booking.html"
    },
    {
      "source": "/lamps",
      "destination": "/lamps.html"
    },
    {
      "source": "/blessing",
      "destination": "/blessing.html"
    },
    {
      "source": "/urgent",
      "destination": "/urgent.html"
    },
    {
      "comment": "17bath.org：沐浴車自己的網域，根路徑直接給預渲染好的沐浴車頁。不這樣做的話，/ 會落到最下面那條萬用規則、送出 index.html——那份的 title 與 og 是和聖壇的，貼到 LINE 的預覽卡會變成「問事、點燈與法會服務」。只有這個網域吃這條規則，heshengtan.tw 的首頁不受影響。",
      "source": "/",
      "has": [{ "type": "host", "value": "(www\\.)?17bath\\.org" }],
      "destination": "/shower.html"
    },
    {
      "comment": "志工打卡的短網址。沒有預渲染也不該被索引（robots.txt 擋），所以直接給 SPA 殼。",
      "source": "/checkin",
      "has": [{ "type": "host", "value": "(www\\.)?17bath\\.org" }],
      "destination": "/index.html"
    },
    {
      "source": "/relocation",
      "destination": "/relocation.html"
    },
    {
      "source": "/deities",
      "destination": "/deities.html"
    },
    {
      "source": "/scripture",
      "destination": "/scripture.html"
    },
    {
      "source": "/calendar",
      "destination": "/calendar.html"
    },
    {
      "source": "/shower",
      "destination": "/shower.html"
    },
    {
      "source": "/bulletins",
      "destination": "/bulletins.html"
    },
    {
      "source": "/privacy",
      "destination": "/privacy.html"
    },
    {
      "source": "/((?!api/).*)",
      "destination": "/index.html"
    }
  ],
  "crons": [
    {
      "path": "/api/keepalive",
      "schedule": "0 1 * * *"
    }
  ]
}
